      "created_at": "2021-10-20T13:58:32Z",
      "updated_at": "2021-10-20T13:58:32Z",
      "body": "Clients can also request `event_id_only` pushes when setting up a pusher with their homeserver.\r\nRiotX (if I remember) used to have a configuration slider — I can't see this in today's Element Android but looking at my homeserver's `pushers` table, it uses the `event_id_only` format (I think this may now be the only supported option).\r\n\r\nElement iOS has been `event_id_only` for as long as I can remember, for what it's worth.",
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "pin": null,
      "reactions": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/matrix-org/synapse/issues/comments/947694984/reactions",
